argin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span>     </span>area bandwidth </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span> </span>95.16181 187.08091 </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">$CI</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span>                     </span>low<span>       </span>ML<span>    \r\n</span>high</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><div style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">area\r\n(<font color=\"#0000ff\">hectares</font>) 58.98609 72.89313 88.25008</font></span></div><div style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks, </font></span></div><div style=\"background:white;margin:0in 0in 0pt;line-height:15pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">Joseph </font></span></div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
